orm{\partial / \partial  m{z} \, g( m{z})} \leq L$, then $\mathcal{L}$ is $L$-Lipschitz. Hence, our objective is to identify the value of $\sup_{ m{z} \in \mathbb{R}^{n_L 	imes k}} 
