orm{ m{y}_{\mathcal{D}} -  m{z}_0}_F^2 = \sigma_{\scalebox{0.65}{$\kern-3pt m{y}_{\mathcal{D}}$}}^2$, which, as a consequence, are critical points. Indeed, for every $ m{z} 
