orm{ m{y}_{\mathcal{D}}}_F^2} \left(\sigma^2ight)^{n_L k /2} \cdot \ & \kern14.65pt \cdot \int_{\mathbb{R}^{n_L 	imes k}} \exp{- rac{1}{2} \left(\sum_{i, j \in [k] 	imes [k]} \left( m{K}'( m{x})^{-1} + 2 \cdot  m{I}_kight)_{i, j}  m{u}_i^T  m{u}_jight)} d m{u}, \end{aligned} \end{align} where the inequality follows applying $
